exports[`ChangelogEntry.astro > matches the snapshot 1`] = `"<details class="changelog-entry not-prose" id="E1.34" data-changelog-entry data-year="2026"><summary class="changelog-entry__summary"><span class="changelog-entry__version">E1.34</span><time class="changelog-entry__date" datetime="2026-08-29">2026/08/29</time><span class="changelog-entry__meta" data-changelog-meta><span class="changelog-entry__total">2 项</span><span class="changelog-tag fishtail fishtail--sm changelog-entry__count text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300">平衡 1</span><span class="changelog-tag fishtail fishtail--sm changelog-entry__count text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-300">修正 1</span></span><span class="changelog-entry__meta" data-changelog-hits hidden></span></summary><ul class="changelog-entry__list"><li class="changelog-remark" data-changelog-item data-tags=""><span data-changelog-text>对之前的版本号做了一些调整。</span></li><li class="changelog-item" data-changelog-item data-tags="平衡"><span class="changelog-item__tags"><span class="changelog-tag fishtail fishtail--sm text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300">平衡</span></span><span class="changelog-item__body"><span data-changelog-text>大调了弓兵系职业。</span><ul class="changelog-item__children"><li class="changelog-sub"><span data-changelog-text>新增了全部兵种的转职。</span></li></ul></span></li><li class="changelog-item" data-changelog-item data-tags="修正 本地化"><span class="changelog-item__tags"><span class="changelog-tag fishtail fishtail--sm text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-300">修正</span><span class="changelog-tag fishtail fishtail--sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">本地化</span></span><span class="changelog-item__body"><span data-changelog-text>修正了日语版部分汉字字形。</span><ul class="changelog-item__children"><li class="changelog-note"><span data-changelog-text>*日语旧字体→日语新字体/许容字体。</span></li></ul></span></li></ul></details>"`;
